                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3f1c1017-f17f-3233-b3a5-39c49330e3e4",
                        "entry_id": "ac73de54-034b-3dcd-b066-a9c22a80797c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "representative of the edinoverie"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "21ccbc6c-e33d-4dd6-8cbe-f969019eaaf5",
                                "sense_id": "3f1c1017-f17f-3233-b3a5-39c49330e3e4",
                                "text": "Это значит, что он, по крайней мере после 1917 года, уже проявляет себя не как «чистый старообрядец», а как своеобразный «единоверец», певец единого Древлеправославия, провозвестник единства Церкви.",
                                "translation": "This means that, at least after 1917, he no longer manifests himself as a \"pure Old Believer,\" but as a kind of \"Coreligionist,\" a singer of the one Ancient Orthodoxy, a proclaimer of the unity of the Church.",
                                "english": "This means that, at least after 1917, he no longer manifests himself as a \"pure Old Believer,\" but as a kind of \"Coreligionist,\" a singer of the one Ancient Orthodoxy, a proclaimer of the unity of the Church."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
